  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yaml at 21.11.0 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n* ci(pre-release): disable the uv cache by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3288\n* ci: pass expressions to run scripts via env by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3292\n* ci(release): audit egress in build and publish by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3289\n* 📝 docs: define maintainer roles and access by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3290\n* ci: resolve zizmor auditor findings by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3297\n* ci(pre-commit): freeze hook revs to commit SHAs by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3298\n* docs: link docs and pyvideo over https by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3300\n* docs(development): add a one-year roadmap by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3304\n* 🐛 fix(seed): fail closed when PyPI digest is unknown by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3302\n* ✨ feat(release): publish SBOMs as release assets by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3299\n* docs(security): describe the project under the CRA by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3295\n* docs(template): name the trust boundary crossed by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3296\n* ♻️ refactor(sbom): type the SPDX renderer by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3307\n* ✨ feat(zipapp): publish an SBOM for the zipapp by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3310\n* 👷 ci(check): pin test tool downloads and bump them weekly by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3293\n* 📝 docs: explain what a release publishes and how to verify it by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3305\n* 👷 ci(release): verify the zipapp served by bootstrap.pypa.io by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3309\n* 👷 ci(release): mint app tokens instead of a PAT by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3301\n* 📝 docs(security): add threat model and assurance case by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3294\n* 🐛 fix(zipapp): bundle wheels pinned by a PEP 751 lock by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3306\n* 📝 docs(security): sync threat model with merged fixes by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3312\n* 🐛 fix(sbom): keep the build machine out of the SBOMs by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3311\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/compare/21.10.0...21.11.0",
  "mentions_count": 1
